      "raw_text": "🔥 BREAKING: \nKathryn Bernardo REVEALS THE SECRET BEHIND HER CONTRACT TO STAR ALONGSIDE LEE MIN HO — IT’S NOT JUST TALENT AND BEAUTY! SHE DISCLOSES THE MYSTERIOUS BACKER WHO MADE HER CHOICE POSSIBLE, LEAVING FANS SHOCKED AND SPEECHLESS!\n\nThe internet is ablaze again, and this time, it’s for a collaboration no one could have predicted: Kathryn Bernardo and Lee Min Ho are officially teaming up for a groundbreaking Filipino-Korean drama titled “PRINCESS.” Fans from Manila to Seoul have erupted with excitement, flooding social media with hashtags like #KathMinHo and #PrincessTheSeries, imagining the first-ever scene where these two beloved stars share the screen.\n#KathrynBernardo #LeeMinHo #leeminhostyle",
      "cleaned_text": "🔥 BREAKING: Kathryn Bernardo REVEALS THE SECRET BEHIND HER CONTRACT TO STAR ALONGSIDE LEE MIN HO — IT’S NOT JUST TALENT AND BEAUTY! SHE DISCLOSES THE MYSTERIOUS BACKER WHO MADE HER CHOICE POSSIBLE, LEAVING FANS SHOCKED AND SPEECHLESS! The internet is ablaze again, and this time, it’s for a collaboration no one could have predicted: Kathryn Bernardo and Lee Min Ho are officially teaming up for a groundbreaking Filipino-Korean drama titled “PRINCESS.” Fans from Manila to Seoul have erupted with excitement, flooding social media with hashtags like #KathMinHo and #PrincessTheSeries, imagining the first-ever scene where these two beloved stars share the screen. #KathrynBernardo #LeeMinHo #leeminhostyle",
      "english_translation": "🔥 BREAKING: Kathryn Bernardo REVEALS THE SECRET BEHIND HER CONTRACT TO STAR ALONGSIDE LEE MIN HO — IT’S NOT JUST TALENT AND BEAUTY! SHE DISCLOSES THE MYSTERIOUS BACKER WHO MADE HER CHOICE POSSIBLE, LEAVING FANS SHOCKED AND SPEECHLESS! The internet is ablaze again, and this time, it’s for a collaboration no one could have predicted: Kathryn Bernardo and Lee Min Ho are officially teaming up for a groundbreaking Filipino-Korean drama titled “PRINCESS.” Fans from Manila to Seoul have erupted with excitement, flooding social media with hashtags like #KathMinHo and #PrincessTheSeries, imagining the first-ever scene where these two beloved stars share the screen. #KathrynBernardo #LeeMinHo #leeminhostyle",
